Tool call input: {'knowledge_bases': ['pubmed_papers', 'clinical_trials'], 'search_rounds_budget': 3, 'search_target': 'Determine whether clinical evaluation or a clinical trial directly evaluated topical pazopanib eye drops versus intravitreal ranibizumab injections in subjects with neovascular age-related macular degeneration (nAMD). Find trial identifiers, design, population, and outcomes if present; distinguish direct head-to-head evaluation from separate or adjunctive studies.'}

